---
title: Matcha Frappuccino
servings: 1
time required: 5 minutes
course: Drink
cuisine: American
image: https://www.starbucks.com.hk/media/catalog/product/p/u/pure_matcha_cream_frappuccino_frap_1.jpg
---

In a #blender, blend together @ice cubes{1%handful}(around 5-8), @milk{1%cup}, @vanilla syrup{1%tbsp}, and @matcha powder{2%tsp} until smooth. Top with @?whip cream{} and @?matcha powder{} as desired.